    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_select_01",
      "hash64": "A8E5277944C90C2F",
      "text": "¿Luna Carmesí?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_select_02",
      "hash64": "A8E5287944C90DE2",
      "text": "¿Ese es el Pokémon que estás buscando?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_camera_07",
      "hash64": "911490A99DBDF894",
      "text": "Sí... Se trata de un Ursaluna al que le llevo\\nsiguiendo la pista mucho tiempo.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_camera_08",
      "hash64": "911487A99DBDE949",
      "text": "Sabes de qué Pokémon te estoy hablando, ¿no?\\nEra bastante común en la antigüedad.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_camera_09",
      "hash64": "911486A99DBDE796",
      "text": "Normalmente, esa especie tiene en la frente un\\nmotivo amarillo que recuerda a una luna llena.\\c\\nPero, en el caso de este ejemplar, la luna es roja.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_camera_10",
      "hash64": "911109A99DBADD58",
      "text": "Es como si un velo de sangre hubiese cubierto\\nla luna... De ahí el apodo de Luna Carmesí.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
